  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Atividade Integrada de Gest&#xe3;o Territorial Ind&#xed;gena</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Indigenous Territorial Management Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Esta atividade, projetada em conjunto com o escrit&#xf3;rio ambiental da USAID/Brasil, fortalecer&#xe1; a capacidade de dez organiza&#xe7;&#xf5;es representativas ind&#xed;genas e das comunidades para proteger e administrar de forma sustent&#xe1;vel os recursos naturais das terras ind&#xed;genas nos estados amaz&#xf4;nicos do Amazonas e Roraima.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity, co-designed with USAID/Brazil&apos;s environment office, will strengthen the capacity of ten indigenous representative organizations and the communities to protect, sustainably manage the natural resources of indigenous lands in the Amazon states of Amazonas and Roraima.</narrative>
  </description>
